Description: Tools for text mining and ordination with clustering analysis of document collections. 
    Converts PDF files to text, filters words by part-of-speech tags, and creates word abundance tables. 
    These are analysed with detrended correspondence analysis, Hill and Gauch (1980) <doi:10.1007/BF00048870>, 
    Ward hierarchical clustering, Ward (1963) <doi:10.1080/01621459.1963.10500845>, 
    and indicator value analysis, Dufrene and Legendre (1997) <doi:10.1890/0012-9615(1997)067[0345:SAAIST]2.0.CO;2>, 
    to identify groups of documents and their characteristic words, with visualisation tools.
